# The doc-builder image (github.com/omnetpp/doc-builder) that every documentation build runs in:
# doc/src/build.sh, and through it `make doc` and the release scripts. Pinned by digest, so that the
# same commit always builds the same documentation; bump it on purpose, together with the image of
# .github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml. The tag is the release the digest was published as.
# doc-builder v1.0.4
